  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Me And My Uncle** (1 review): Reviewer insists the actual set opened with Cold Rain and Snow; the archive recording begins a few notes into this song [3]\n- **Not Fade Away** (1 other source): Not Fade Away goes into Goin' Down The Road Feelin' Bad and returns to Not Fade Away, then We Bid You Good Night [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Connections**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [8]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Bobby McGee [8]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1971-03-21.165920.LP.Doinker.flac1644** (recommended): source not stated; 7 songs; 38 min [1]\n- **gd71-03-21.aud.cotsman.12074.sbeok.shnf**: audience recording; 7 songs; 35 min; rated 2/5 by 5 [2]. Said about its sound: Fairly decent audience recording for its era, with minor vinyl crackles audible because a bootleg LP is in the lineage [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer also taped the show on a cheap mono Panasonic recorder; that tape has long been lost [3]\n- Show was oversold and counterfeit tickets circulated beforehand; doors opened only fifteen minutes before showtime, causing a stampede by people without tickets [4]\n- Venue eventually regained control and stopped admitting people, leaving Pat Small, Amy Kirkland and friends locked out [4]\n- Attendee, at his first Dead show, says the performance was not cut short and still owns a poster [7]\n- Deadlists says the band played only one short set because they had to catch a plane [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1971-03-21.165920.LP.Doinker.flac1644**: transferred by Doinker; source: Mega-rare restored LP \"Spring Tour '71\" [1]\n- **gd71-03-21.aud.cotsman.12074.sbeok.shnf**: transferred by Chuck Kiefe and JCotsman; source: Audience [2]. Also: Recording derives from a bootleg LP the reviewer bought at Brady & Farwell in Milwaukee [7]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Bob Marks Grateful Dead: [1971-03-21 Exposition Center, Milwaukee, WI, USA - Jerry Garcia](https://jerrygarcia.com/show/1971-03-21-exposition-center-milwaukee-wi-usa/) [9]\n- Poster by Jerry Garcia: [1971-03-21 GD NRPS Poster - Jerry Garcia](https://jerrygarcia.com/image/1971-03-21-gd-nrps-poster/) [10]\n- Poster by Jerry Garcia: [1971-03-21 GD NRPS Poster - Jerry Garcia](https://jerrygarcia.com/image/1971-03-21-ticket/) [11]",
